ILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▷ &nbsp;부전공 해당 “종합학사행정실”</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▷ 소속 학부(과)장의 추천을 받아 부전공 학부(과)장에게 제출</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 3. <strong>신청 서류</strong>&nbsp;</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 부전공 이수 신청서 1부.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 성적증명서 1부.</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 4. <strong>신청 자격</strong></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 2학년 이상[2012학년도 2학기 기준]</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp; ▷ 이수신청 직전학기까지의 평점평균이 3.00 이상</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp; 5. <strong>신청학부 및 허용인원</strong></span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▷ 신청학부 : 붙임&nbsp;참조</span><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;&nbsp;▷ 허용인원 : 전공별 입학정원의 50%이내에서 선발[붙임 참조]</span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></p><p>&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp; </p><hr style=\"BORDER-RIGHT: black 0px; BORDER-TOP: black 1px solid; BORDER-LEFT: black 0px; BORDER-BOTTOM: black 0px; HEIGHT: 1px\"><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><br><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 12pt; FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\">2012. 07. 31.</span></p><p style=\"LINE-HEIGHT: 2; TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\">&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: right\">&nbsp;</p><p>&nbsp;</p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Arial\"><span style=\"FONT-FAMILY: Batang,바탕\"><strong><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt\">교 무 처 장</span></strong></span></span></p><p style=\"TEXT-ALIGN: center\"><span style=